                                        "entry_id": "64a14dd8-48df-3840-804a-a5d0bdab18f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mammal which lives partly or wholly in the ocean, or at least is heavily dependent on the ocean for its lifestyle; such as cetaceans, sirenians, seals, the sea otter or the polar bear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
